{"availability":"available","full":"GoPlasmatic/dataflow-rs","name":"dataflow-rs","description":"A high-performance rules engine for IFTTT-style automation in Rust with zero-overhead JSONLogic evaluation","category":"Developer tools","language":"Rust","stars":47,"forks":7,"created":"2025-01-25T06:06:29Z","updated":"2026-10-12T22:43:51Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://goplasmatic.github.io/dataflow-rs/debugger/","topics":["data-pipeline","event-driven","rust","workflow-engine"],"demo":"https://goplasmatic.github.io/dataflow-rs/playground.html","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T13:01:03.321Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T13:01:03.321Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T13:01:03.321Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T16:43:40.915Z","stars":46,"forks":7},{"at":"2026-10-13T02:11:49.456Z","stars":47,"forks":7},{"at":"2026-10-15T13:01:03.321Z","stars":47,"forks":7}],"technologies":["Rust"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A high-performance rules engine for IFTTT-style automation in Rust with zero-overhead JSONLogic evaluation.","Two chained rules in the visual debugger: IF the condition matches, THEN the next rule runs. Try it live in your browser →","Dataflow-rs is a lightweight, embeddable rules engine that lets you define IF → THEN → THAT automation in JSON. The engine compiles every rule's JSONLogic once at startup, so evaluation does no parsing at runtime, and actions execute asynchronously. Use it to route events, validate data, or build multi-step automation pipelines."],"features":["IF → THEN → THAT Model: Define rules with JSONLogic conditions, execute actions, chain with priority ordering.","Zero Runtime Compilation: All JSONLogic expressions compiled once at startup, never per message.","Full Context Access: Conditions can read any field in data, metadata, and tempdata.","Secrets Outside the Record: {\"secret\": \"name\"} reads an engine-scoped store that no trace, snapshot or serialized message ever contains, and build() refuses a workflow that would copy one into the message.","Async-First Architecture: Native async/await on the Tokio runtime."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/GoPlasmatic/dataflow-rs/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"ad3442b36305e16720c96ecad440ed9ea1ab6f9cc43ea34cfe685ad4cec2ee68","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T16:43:41.009Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T13:01:03.470Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A high-performance rules engine for IFTTT-style automation in Rust with zero-overhead JSONLogic evaluation.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/GoPlasmatic/dataflow-rs/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"ad3442b36305e16720c96ecad440ed9ea1ab6f9cc43ea34cfe685ad4cec2ee68","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/GoPlasmatic/dataflow-rs/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T13:01:03.470Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-12T22:43:51Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/GoPlasmatic/dataflow-rs/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T13:01:03.471Z","hash":"ad3442b36305e16720c96ecad440ed9ea1ab6f9cc43ea34cfe685ad4cec2ee68","originalBytes":32926,"storedBytes":32926,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T13:01:03.321Z","subjects":["Automation & workflows"],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Developer tools","subjects":["Automation & workflows"],"evidence":[{"subject":"Automation & workflows","source":"metadata","match":"automation"}],"platformEvidence":[],"platformSupport":"author_metadata_not_runtime_tested","suggestedSubjects":["Templates & UI components","Data & dashboards"],"reviewRequired":true},"demoHealth":{"url":"https://goplasmatic.github.io/dataflow-rs/playground.html","attemptedAt":"2026-10-13T02:38:17.309Z","probeVersion":3,"status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-13T02:38:17.309Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-13T02:38:17.309Z","target":"https://goplasmatic.github.io/dataflow-rs/playground